id: pm-opw1l3
title: "MCP post-2026-07-28 evolution programme: agentic messaging, unified HTTP transport, agent identity, progressive primitives, and SDK experience"
description: Continuously adopt the official MCP roadmap beyond the 2026-07-28 conformance baseline while keeping the public pm SDK as the policy owner and the CLI and MCP servers as thin adapters. The programme tracks emerging specification and extension work as explicit independently releasable capabilities instead of mixing future proposals into the completed 2026 conformance tranche.
