acceptance_criteria: Every official roadmap priority has one canonical owner and an upstream evidence link; proposal status never masquerades as normative conformance; public SDK contracts land before CLI or MCP adapters; real stdio and Streamable HTTP processes prove interoperability; security privacy token and resource bounds have negative controls; deprecation windows and migration receipts remain explicit; released npm npx bunx and MCP consumers prove each promoted capability
